## Ideas to steal (no new deps)

- **Helms / Zourdos:** 6 @ RPE 5 is a lower %1RM than 6 @ RPE 6, so e1RM is **higher**. Steal the **order**, not the table.
- **RTS 6–10 charts:** why this repo’s `RPE_CHART` starts at 6. Not a reason to flatten backoff e1RM.
- **This repo’s floor rule:** keep the clamp and missing-RPE guard. Steal nothing else from its cap/200 section.
- **MATH_VERSION pin:** only cross-language contract. Client preview until sync; backend remains canonical (`architecture.md` §3.1 / §10.2).

Forbidden deps: `brzycki`, `epley`, Liftosaur cores, OpenPowerlifting calculators, extra npm/pip math packages.

